# The manual demo (decisions §40 16): command lines gen-demo replays on top of the generated
# rig before it saves library/shows/demo.luma. One line per row, `#` starts a comment, every
# line runs as Admin. Keep here what the demo is to have beyond the imports — the profile as
# `Set UserProfile …` lines, groups, masters, views; the journal shows every line a session ran.

# Group 1 (Photon) is a scaling master (decisions §22).
Set Group 1 "Mode" Scaling

# Presets (decisions 0288): one pool, stored from the programmer. A Universal dimmer level, a
# Selective pair, each tagged so the Presets window has something to sort.
Fixture 101 Thru 110 At 100
Store Preset 1 "Full"
ResetAll
Fixture 101 Thru 110 At 50
Store Preset 2 "Half"
ResetAll
Fixture 101 At 20
Fixture 102 At 80
Store Preset 3 "Split"
ResetAll
Store Tag 901 "Wash"
Assign Tag "Wash" At Preset 1 + 2

# A sequence whose cues link Presets 1-3 (decisions 0293): a value called from a preset is stored as
# the link only, so the cues play the presets as they are now. Cue 3 holds a plain value beside
# its links (Fixture 103), so Update has a cue with plain values too.
Store Sequence 1 "Presets"
Fixture 101 Thru 110 At Preset 1
Store Sequence 1 Cue 1 "Full"
ResetAll
Fixture 101 Thru 110 At Preset 2
Store Sequence 1 Cue 2 "Half"
ResetAll
Fixture 101 + 102 At Preset 3
Fixture 103 At 30
Store Sequence 1 Cue 3 "Split"
ResetAll
